WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.000
Step 1: Open Knowledge Library with publishing permission and create or edit an article.

2
00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:12.000
Step 2: Choose its title, Policies/Information type, category and company or authorised network audience.

3
00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:18.000
Step 3: Use the formatting editor to add text, tables, media, accordions or callouts.

4
00:00:18.000 --> 00:00:24.000
Step 4: Review the article and save/publish through its ordinary editor action. Refresh if another editor changed its revision.
